{
  "id": "02_ghost_market",
  "title": "鬼市",
  "atmosphere": { "time": "深夜", "weather": "幽光", "mood": "诡异" },
  "texts": [
    {
      "content": "你走进一片集市。摊位上摆满了奇怪的东西：玻璃瓶里装着发着微光的雾气，铜镜里映出别人的面容，还有一本本没有字的书。摊主们都是半透明的，他们看着你，眼神里有惊讶，也有贪婪。",
      "delay": 0
    },
    {
      "content": "你在集市中穿行，忽然一个声音叫住了你。",
      "delay": 2500
    },
    {
      "content": "{{NPC_SLOT_1:greeting}}",
      "delay": 1500
    },
    {
      "content": "是{{NPC_SLOT_1:name}}。{{NPC_SLOT_1:identity}}。",
      "delay": 1000
    },
    {
      "content": "{{NPC_SLOT_1:reveal}}",
      "delay": 2000
    }
  ],
  "choices": [
    {
      "text": "“我想了解更多。”",
      "target": "05_yellow_spring_road",
      "effects": { "wisdom": 1, "setFlag": "sympathized" },
      "condition": null
    },
    {
      "text": "“这不关我的事。”",
      "target": "05_yellow_spring_road",
      "effects": { "mood": "淡然" },
      "condition": null
    }
  ],
